# Lint Overview

_Updated 2026-06-03 (post preserve-manual-memoization fix)._

`pnpm lint` → **0 errors, 302 warnings** in 130 files. All warnings = `react-hooks/*` (React Compiler rules). Grouped by rule, ordered easiest → hardest to fix.

**Effort:** 🟢 trivial · 🟡 medium · 🟠 high · 🔴 very high
**Risk if left** (cost of NOT fixing) & **Risk to fix** (chance the fix breaks behavior): 🟢 low · 🟡 medium · 🟠 high · 🔴 severe

| # | Rule | Count | Effort | Risk if left | Risk to fix | Description |
|---|------|------:|:------:|:----:|:----:|-------------|
| 1 | `react-hooks/preserve-manual-memoization` | ~~10~~ → **2** ✅ | 🟡 | 🟢 | 🟠 | **8 fixed** (commit `c382a798`): dropped redundant manual `useCallback`/`useMemo` → Compiler auto-memoizes. **2 left intentional**: `git-diff-store.ts` `useSyncExternalStore` memo is load-bearing (stable subscribe/getSnapshot) — unwrap → resubscribe loop. Risk-to-fix now 🟠 (easy unwraps done; only the load-bearing tail remains). Risk-if-left stays 🟢 — manual memo still runs at runtime, cost = lost Compiler opt on that hook only. |
| 2 | `react-hooks/static-components` | 11 | 🟢 | 🟠 | 🟡 | Component defined inside another's render → new type each render, **remounts subtree** = lost state/focus, flicker. Fix = hoist to module scope; risk = closed-over props/state must become explicit props. |
| 3 | `react-hooks/purity` | 5 | 🟢 | 🟠 | 🟡 | Impure work during render (mutation, `Date.now`/random, side effect) → breaks Compiler memo, tearing. Fix = move to effect/handler; risk = timing/order shift. |
| 4 | `react-hooks/immutability` | 14 | 🟡 | 🔴 | 🟡 | Mutating props/state/hook returns → silent stale UI, skipped renders. Fix = clone-then-set; risk = shared refs elsewhere, shallow vs deep clone. |
| 5 | `react-hooks/refs` | 104 | 🟠 | 🟡 | 🟠 | Read/write `ref.current` during render (valid only in effects/handlers). Subtle stale reads; high volume, each fix can shift render timing → regression-prone. |
| 6 | `react-hooks/set-state-in-effect` | 166 | 🔴 | 🟡 | 🔴 | `setState` in `useEffect` → cascade re-render, extra paints, loops. Fix = derive during render / lift state / `useMemo`; biggest redesign per site → highest break chance. |

